Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 756 "[Lemegeton] Duke of True Chivalry"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900275000
    Collect 1 of 900276000
    Collect 1 of 900277000

Requires player level >= 74 and quest 755 is completed

Rewards
    Give 10000000 experience
    Give 30000 coins
    Give 1 of 900278000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "The sealing is almost done. I hope nothing goes wrong during the process. Go to [Order of the Sorcery]Bros and let him know."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "The sealing is almost done. I hope nothing goes wrong during the process. Go to [Order of the Sorcery]Seis and let him know."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Here you are. The [Association of Magic] has found a better place to stay."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The [Devil15]Eligos is one of the true devils. You <selfname> are a great knight, so it would be an epic battle for you two. [Devil39]Malphas and [Devil62]Volac are to be sealed as well.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [15Devil] Eligos, [39Devil] Malphas, and [62Devil] Volac."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here now. They have found a new place."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The [Devil15]Eligos is one of the true devils. You <selfname> are a great knight, so it would be an epic battle for you two. [Devil39]Malphas and [Devil62]Volac are to be sealed as well.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [15Devil] Eligos, [39Devil] Malphas, and [62Devil] Volac."

On in_progress
    Say "They are not sealed yet? Okay then, I'll send you to that place again."

On claimable
    Show quest "They are completely sealed. Now the three devils are sealed forever."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "It seems that their forces became weakened due to the continuous sealing. I think it was effective to seal from the lower level devils. Now, it's time to remove their brain. It's [Devil 3] Vassago whom you must fight against this time. [Devil 3] Vassago is playing a key role as their brain with his infinite wisdom and ability to look into the past and the future. It's time for him to step down from his post. Go to [Eslant] with the [Devil 3 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you. Find [Devil 3 Summoning Stone], and then summon and destroy him."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "It seems that their forces became weakened due to the continuous sealing. I think it was effective to seal from the lower level devils. Now, it's time to remove their brain. It's [Devil 3] Vassago who you have to fight against, this time. [Devil 3] Vassago is playing a key role as their brain with his infinite wisdom and ability to look into the past and the future. It's time for him to step down from his post. Go to [Eslant] with the [Devil 3 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you. Find [Devil 3 Summoning Stone], and then summon and destroy him."
